 kampung/dusun/banjar/jorong."}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider","children":"Pengertian Desa Menurut Para Ahli Kependudukan:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-emerald-50/60 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200/80 space-y-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-emerald-900 block","children":"1. Menurut R. Bintarto"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Desa yaitu perwujudan atau kesatuan sosial, ekonomi, geografi, politik, serta kultural yang ada di suatu daerah dalam hubungan dan pengaruhnya secara timbal balik dengan daerah lain."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-blue-50/60 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-blue-200/80 space-y-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-blue-900 block","children":"2. Menurut Rifhi Siddiq"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Desa adalah suatu wilayah yang memiliki tingkat kepadatan rendah yang dihuni oleh penduduk dengan interaksi sosial yang bersifat homogen, bermatapencaharian di bidang agraris dan juga mampu berinteraksi dengan wilayah lain di sekitarnya."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-purple-50/60 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-purple-200/80 space-y-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-purple-900 block","children":"3. Menurut Sutardjo Kartohadikusumo"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Desa adalah suatu kesatuan hukum yang di dalamnya bertempat tinggal sekelompok masyarakat yang berkuasa mengadakan pemerintahan sendiri."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-amber-50/60 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200/80 space-y-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-amber-900 block","children":"4. Menurut Paul H. Landis"}],"$L21"]}]]}]]}],"$L22","$L23"]}],"$L24","$L25"]}]
